    ph\u01B0\u01A1ng ki\u1EC3m duy\u1EC7t.\n\nGhi ch\xFA: \u0110\u1EC1 thi th\u1EF1c
    h\xE0nh s\u1EBD \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c cho h\u1ECDc vi\xEAn sau khi k\u1EBFt th\xFAc
    kh\xF3a h\u1ECDc tr\u1EF1c ti\u1EBFp.\n\n2.2 Ch\u01B0\u01A1ng tr\xECnh \u0111\xE0o
    t\u1EA1o tr\u1EF1c ti\u1EBFp (giai \u0111o\u1EA1n 2) c\xF9ng Th\u1EA7y Nguy\u1EC5n
    Tr\u1ECDng M\u1EA1nh\n\n+ B\xE0i 1: Ngo\u1EA1i quan \u0111\u1EA5t v\u01B0\u1EE3ng
    - \u0111\u1ECDc \u0111\u1ECBa th\u1EBF b\u1EB1ng t\u01B0 duy khoa h\u1ECDc\n\n+
    B\xE0i 2: Nguy\xEAn l\xFD, c\xE1ch s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng \u0111i\u1EC3m ho\xE0ng
    c\u1EF1c (\u0111i\u1EC3m t\u1EED)\n\n+ B\xE0i 3: C\xE1c ph\u01B0\u01A1ng ph\xE1p
    chi\xEAu t\xE0i\n\n+ B\xE0i 4: Xem ng\xE0y v\u01B0\u1EE3ng c\xE1t\n\n+ B\xE0i
    5: Nguy\xEAn t\u1EAFc quy ho\u1EA1ch d\u1EF1 \xE1n theo phong th\u1EE7y khoa
    h\u1ECDc\n\n+ B\xE0i 6: Ph\u01B0\u01A1ng ph\xE1p \u0111\u1ECBnh v\u1ECB tr\xED
    huy\u1EC7t m\u1ED9\n\n+ B\xE0i 7: Th\u1EF1c h\xE0nh quy ho\u1EA1ch d\u1EF1 \xE1n
    khu d\xE2n c\u01B0, c\xF4ng vi\xEAn ngh\u0129a trang, nh\xE0 m\xE1y,\u2026\n\n+
    B\xE0i 8: K\u1EF9 n\u0103ng t\u01B0 v\u1EA5n v\xE0 h\xE0nh tr\xECnh x\xE2y d\u1EF1ng
    ni\u1EC1m tin \u0111\u1EBFn gia ch\u1EE7\n\n \n\nIII. KH\xD3A H\u1ECCC COACHING
