    1) Coaching 1-1 c\xF9ng Th\u1EA7y Truy\u1EC1n th\u1EEBa \u0110\u1EA1i Nam\n\n+
    B\xE0i 1: Quy tr\xECnh t\u01B0 v\u1EA5n c\u1EE7a Th\u1EA7y Phong th\u1EE7y\n\n+
    B\xE0i 2: Nguy\xEAn t\u1EAFc v\xE0ng trong t\u01B0 v\u1EA5n Phong th\u1EE7y\n\n+
    B\xE0i 3: L\u1ED9 tr\xECnh ph\xE1t tri\u1EC3n c\u1EE7a Phong th\u1EE7y s\u01B0\n\n+
    B\xE0i 4: X\xE2y d\u1EF1ng th\u01B0\u01A1ng hi\u1EC7u Th\u1EA7y Phong th\u1EE7y\n\n+
    B\xE0i 5: Th\u1EF1c h\xE0nh t\u1EA1i \u0111\u1ECBa ph\u01B0\u01A1ng\n\n+ B\xE0i
    6: Th\u1EF1c h\xE0nh tham gia c\xF9ng Th\u1EA7y Truy\u1EC1n th\u1EEBa l\xE0m
    \xE2m ph\u1EA7n\n\n 3.3 Th\u1EDDi gian Coaching:\n\n+ H\u1ECDc vi\xEAn vui l\xF2ng
    th\xF4ng b\xE1o cho \u0110\u1EA1i Nam th\u1EDDi gian \u0111\u0103ng k\xFD h\u1ECDc
    Coaching 1-1 tr\u01B0\u1EDBc 10 ng\xE0y l\xE0m vi\u1EC7c \u0111\u1EC3 \u0110\u1EA1i
    Nam c\xF3 k\u1EBF ho\u1EA1ch s\u1EAFp x\u1EBFp Th\u1EA7y Truy\u1EC1n th\u1EEBa
    \u0111\xE0o t\u1EA1o Coaching 1-1 t\u1EA1i Chi nh\xE1nh \u0111\u1ECBa ph\u01B0\u01A1ng.\n\n3.4:
    Thi c\u1EA5p Gi\u1EA5y ch\u1EE9ng nh\u1EADn Th\u1EA7y Phong th\u1EE7y \u0110\u1EA1i
    Nam\n\nSau khi ho\xE0n th\xE0nh v\xE0 \u0111\u1EA1t y\xEAu c\u1EA7u ph\u1EA7n
    Th\u1EF1c h\xE0nh, h\u1ECDc vi\xEAn s\u1EBD tham gia thi s\xE1t h\u1EA1ch v\u1EDBi
    H\u1ED9i \u0111\u1ED3ng chuy\xEAn m\xF4n \u0111\u1EC3 c\u1EA5p Gi\u1EA5y ch\u1EE9ng
    nh\u1EADn \u201CTh\u1EA7y Phong th\u1EE7y \u0110\u1EA1i Nam\u201D\n\nI.     KH\xD3A
